<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n83997" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πλύμα</span></b> 
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">[ῠ]</span>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ατος</span>, τό, (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πλύνω</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>water in which
				something has been washed,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π. ἰχθύων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.Com.
					82
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>HA</u>
				534a27
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Nic.
				<u>Al.</u>
				258
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κρεῶν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Gal.
					18(1).730
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π. ἀλεύρου</span>
			<i>infusion</i> of meal, <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Epid.</u>
				7.80
			</span></i>, <i>Acut.(Sp.</i>) <i><span class="en">
				63
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πλύματα τοῖς παιδαρίοις</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>PCair.Zen.</u>
					398.10
				</span></i>
			
			<span class="entity">(iii B.C.)</span>; <i>washings, scum,</i> a by-product of
			cinnabar, <i><span class="en">
				Thphr.
				<u>Lap.</u>
				58
			</span></i> (in form <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πλύσματι</span>); from
			oilworks, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Sammelb.</u>
				4425 vii 10
			</span></i><span class="entity">(ii A. D.)</span>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> metaph., <i>low prostitute,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Poll.
				7.39
			</span></i>.—The form <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πλύσμα</span>
			is found in some codd. and preferred by <i><span class="en">
				Phot.
			</span></i>; but <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πλύμα</span> is guaranteed by
			metre in Nic.l.c., also by <u>PCair.Zen.</u>l. c.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
